{"id":"6b6f79350e88da2c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-submodmin.md","title":"Submodular minimizers form a sublattice","display":"thm-submodmin — Submodular minimizers form a sublattice","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-submodmin","aliases":["27-thm-submodmin"],"display":"thm-submodmin — Submodular minimizers form a sublattice","depends_on":["[[27-df-submodular]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.3","source_statement":"Local corollary of Definition 13.12","source_printed_pages":"599","source_pdf_pages":"623","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-submodmin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-submodmin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-submodmin — Submodular minimizers form a sublattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local corollary of Definition 13.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"599"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"623"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\;(x\\wedge y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\land x\\vee y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\;(x\\wedge y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\land x\\vee y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是从原书 Definition 13.12 导出的本地推论，原书此处没有同名编号定理。令 m=min f；若 x,y 都取 m，submodularity 给出 2m≥f(x∧y)+f(x∨y)，而两项各≥m，故两项都等于 m。极小点非空由有限域保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-submodular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Submodular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\;(x\\wedge y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\land x\\vee y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)).","display":true}],"bytes":1405,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-565","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-submodmin|thm-submodmin — Submodular minimizers form a sublattice]]"}],"outgoing":["9c7a7ba711a14913","a668791f62b82e2a"]}